<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Kaatap Late</book>
  <para style="h">Kaatap Late</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kaatap Late</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kaatap Late</para>
  <para style="mt">Kaatap Late</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei lai in mihing taw a kidim Jerusalem khuapi bangza in ngamkhing ziam! Leitung ii khatvei a zatak ngei sia tu in meingongnu khat taw kibang hi; khuapi teng po pan a tuanngenbel sia sila dinmun ah taak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zankhuateakin ama kap a; a biangkho ah thitui luang suk vahii hi. A lawm a ngual masa te khat zongh ama heeneam tu taang ngawl hi, A kipawlpuite in ama leeheak zo a, tu in langpan tek ta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah ii mite sia inn pan zawthawk thu taw a kihawlkeak a cimaw silate ahi uh hi. Ngamdang ah amate sila in om a, a mun, a ngam ci tu nei ngawl uh hi — Ngalte in kiim uum a, a suatak natu lam bing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni thiangtho nite ah biakna vawt tu in, Biakinnpi ah kuama hong pai ngawl hi. Tua munah lasa ngaknute in ngim thuak a, a thiampite mau vangui thei bek hi. Khuapi kongpite hawm a, Zion in ngim thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ngalte in ama zo a; amate khutnuai ah koi hi. A khialna tam mamate hangin Topa in ngim thuaksak hi; A tate kipummat in kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem phatna sia bo zo hi. A lampuite sia sangai ngilkial a thazawm, savaite mai ah a tai ciang a tha bo dedek te bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in a ngamkhing, a siacip sa Jerusalem khua in nidang a phatna nung phaw kik hi. A ngalte khut sung a thet ciang a hu tu kuama om ngawl hi; A ngallelna sia ama a zote in nuisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A minphatna teng bo a; a pumnguak in om a ngual zawnsak thuak hi. Ama tau a maizum in a mai seal hi. Jerusalem in lipkhaphuai mawna taw ama le ama kininsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thiantho ngawlna ol tak kimu a, ahizong a thuak tu sia awlmawk ngawl hi. Ama lelna sia nasia leilam a kuama in heeneam zo ngawl hi. A ngalte in zothal ahiciang, Topa tungah hesuak ngen in kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ngalte in ama ii a nei a lamh theampo suttol hi. Topa ii Gentile te pai tu a khaamna mun Biakinnpi sung mama ah a ngalte a tum sia ama in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mite in bang khat po neak tu a zon uh ciang mau vangui uh hi; Amate in a nuntak thei natu in a nei a lamhte an taw theak uh hi. “Kei hong en ka ven, Topa awng; ka ngim nga zia hong mu ta'n,” ci in a khuapi bup in ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kei hong en ka ven!” ci in ama kaantan in a pai theampo tungah ko hi. “Kei nat bangin kuama in a na thuak ngeingawl hi. Topa in a thin uuk laitak hong thuaksak natna a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ama in tungsang pan mei hong khiaksuk a, tua mei in ka sung hong kaangh hi. Ama in kei thaang hong sia a, lei ah hong sial hi. Tua zawkciang ama in hong taisan a, a na thuak tan tu in hong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ama in ka mawna theampo ciamtee a, a vekpi in sawm khawm hi; Tuate ka ngawng kiim ah hong awsak a, a ngitna thuak la in ka thazawm hi. Topa in ka ngalte khut sungah hong aap a, ka cimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Topa in ka ngalkap thahatbelte theampo nuisan lel a; Ama in ka tangvalte a lalsak tu in ngalkaphonpi khat puak hi. Sapit ngoaina sungah sapitngate kingoai thap bangin ka mite ama in sucip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tua hu in ka mittangte thitui taw kidim leet hi. Kuama in hong heeneam thei ngawl a; kuama in hong hanthawn thei ngawl hi. Ngalte in hong zothal a; ka mite in bangma nei nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ka khutte zan kaleng kuama in hong hu ngawl hi. Mun theampo pan kei hong langpan tu ngalte Topa in sam zo hi. Amate in a kiihuai nate bangin kei hong vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ahihang Topa sia a maan hi a, keima in a thu ka nit ngawl hang hi zaw hi. Hong ngai tavun, mun theampo a om mite awng; a na ka thuak hong en tavun. Ka ngaknute le ka tangvalte sia ngalmat in kipaipui siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka pawlpuite ka sam a, ahihang amate in hong hu nuam ngawl hi. Thiampite le lampuite sia nuntak natu an a zon laitak ma in khuapi lampite tungah thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ Topa awng, na ka sak nate, ka thinbot vangui nate hong en ta'n! Ka mawnate hangin khuangai in ka thin tamhtham hi. Lampite ah kithalupna om a; innsuum sungsang ngawngawn ah thina theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka tau nate hong ngai ta'n; hong heeneam tu kuama om ngawl hi. Tuasiatna nong thuaksak manin ka ngalte lungdam uh hi. Nong kamciam ni hong thengsak ta'n a; keima thuak bangin ka ngalte thuaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Amate seksolnate theampo hu in amate ningkhiin in; Ka mawnate hu in daan nong piak bangma in amate daan pia in. Thasiatna taw ka tau a, ka thin na hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa a thin uuk in Zion sia khuazing taw tuam zo hi. A vantung hoina te ama in sia sak zo hi. A thin uuk ni in a Biakinnpi ngawngawn nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Judah ngam khuano theampo hesuak ngawlin lalthamsak a, Ngam huukna kulhpite baltham hi. Ama in kumpi ngam le a ukte maizum pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a thinso in Israel te thahatna saattham hi. Ngalte hong kuan ciang ama in hong hu nuam ngawl hi. Kaanghmei bangin ama in ei hong zaap keak a, na theampo lalthamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite sia ngal bang phetin a thaltangte taw hong tuung hi; Ih lungdamna le ih diksak theampo ama in thatlum hi. Hi lai Jerusalem ah ama ii thin uukna meikuang eite in ih thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in ngal khat bangin Israel susia zo hi. Ama in a kulhte le kumpi innte a zaancip sa in nusia hi. Ama in Judah mite tungah a bo thei ngawl heena tungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama ih biakna mun Biakinnpi sia ama in a bebekin sutham hi. Ama in ni thiangthote le Sabbath te bosak zo hi. Kumpipa le thiampipa in ama thin uukna a kibangin thuak khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in a biaknatau nial a, ama ii a thiangtho Biakinnpi taisan hi. Ama in Biakinn pangte sia ngalte in balthamsak hi. Khatvei lai in lungdamna taw ih biakna munah amate ngalzo in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion khuapi luphungte a cipthap tu sia Topa in ciangtan zo hi. A vekpi a sia tu in ama in see zo hi. Tu in tausaangte le luphungte lal khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kongpite sia leivum suangvum sungah kivuknelh a, a zawlte a bebekin kivaat tham zo hi. Kumpipa le namliante tu in saltaang in om hi. Thukham kihil nawn ngawlin, kamsaangte in mu kholnate Topa ii tung pan nga ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem ii pasal huaite sia huthe ngawlin lei ah to khipkhep uh hi. A lu tungah leivui kithe in khau-ip puan silh uh hi. Ngaknu note lei ah a lu kun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ka kaana in ka mitte paat zo a, ka thin na mama hi. Ka mite lalna hangin hee in ka tha zawm ngawp hi. Patangnote le nausente khuapi lampite ah butthi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ngilkial dangtaak in a nute kaa uh hi. Amate sia a liamte bang phetin lampi ah puk uh a, Tuaciang a nute ii kaang sungah dadam in thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, kong it Jerusalem awng, bang kong ci thei tu ziam? Bangbangin nang hong heeneam thei tu khi ziam? Kuama in hi bang peuma in thuak ngeingawl hi. Na tuasiatna sia tuipi bangin mong nei ngawl a; bangma muanmawk thei tu om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kamsaangte in leilot thu ngawl po nang tungah son tu nei ngawl hi. Na mawna a pholaak ngeingawl amate thuhilna taw nang hong theam ahi hi. Amate in na kisii kik tu a kul ngawl tu dongin hong ngaisunsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuapi kaantan in a pai mihingte in nangma hong ngaimawk et uh hi. Amate in Jerusalem ii zaanthapna sia a lu pei in nuisan uh hi: “Hisia, tua khuapi hoi sia ma hi kana ziam? Hisia, leitung bup ii kiphatsakpui sia hi ka na ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ngalte theampo in hong selno in etsatna taw nang hong salh uh hi. Amate mukmen in “Khuapi lalthamsak zo hing! hisia ih ngalaakbel ni hi!” ci in selno uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in hong tawnna teng a khak belin tungsak hi. Ama in hun saupi lai a eite kidop natu hong hil sa bangin hesuakna om ngawlin hong lalsak hi. Ama in ih ngalte ngalzosak a, ih ngallelna ah amate lungdamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, na luphungte mama in Topa ko tahen! Na thituite a sun a zanin ngun bangin luangsak in; kaana le khuangaina taw nangma le nangma kingawt in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zankhuateak Topa tungah ko tu in tho kikik in! Na thin na lung takpi taw na patangte — lampi king sim ah neak tu nei ngawl pukhong in a thi tu na patangte atu in ama tungah hesuak ngen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />En in, Topa awng! Banghang hi bangin daan hong thuaksak ni ziam! Nupite in a it a tate ii sa ne uh hi! Thiampite le kamsaangte sia Biakinnpi sung mama ah kithatlum hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A moi a haam a kibangin lampi ah thi uh hi. Ngalte in ngaknu le tangval teng namsau taw thatlum uh hi. Na thin uuk ni in hesuak ngawlin amate na thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma in keima ii kiim ah hong lausak poai vawt tu in ka ngalte na sam a, Tuaciang tua na thin uuk ni in kuama suakta zo ngawl hi. Amate in itna taw ka vak ka taa sa tanote suamlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii daan piakna bangbang tatak hi tu ziam ci in a he sia keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in khuazing sungah a thuk vaial, a thuk vaial in kei hong hawlkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in hong hesuak ngawlin kei hong vevel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ka samal sia a at babangin nusia a, ka ngu ka taang thiaktan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in thasiatna le mauna thong sungah hong khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a uih thina khuazing sungah kei hong teangsak hamtang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in thikkhau taw hong heen a; suatak tu muanmawk om ngawl thongtaak a, a luangta khat ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hu ngenin nging takin ka kap a, ahizong Pathian in hong ngai nuam ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lam ka pai ciang ka hoi vadai a; ka heakna mun theampo ah suangpangte in ka mai hong khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vompui khat bangin ama in kei hong pang nginge a; tawpi khat bangin ama in hong baw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in lam puasia ah kei hong del a, hong balneen in hong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a thal keak a, kei sia a thaltangte taw phutuunna in hong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a thaltangte taw ka pumpi thuk bunin hong kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihingte in sunkhuateak in kei hong nuisan a; amate theampo atu in kei sia ciammuina ka suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An le tui hong piak taangin ama in nasia takin hong thuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in ka maitang lei ah hong tat a, suangtum tungah ka hate sutan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cidamna, thinnopna le lungdamna cite bang ziam ci sia ka mangil zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuangei nungta nawn ngawl tu khi hi; Topa sungah ka lametna bo zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Natna ka thuakna, inn le lo nei ngawlin ka omnate ka ngaisut sia nguu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tawntungin tuate ka ngaisun a, ka thin kiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahizong hi thu khat ka phaw ciang, lametna hong piang kik hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kiam ngeingawl Topa ii hong itna le hong hesuakna kizom suak lai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />zing khuavak bangin thak suak tawntung a, nisuak pealmaw bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa bekma ka nei hi a, ama tung bek ah ka lametna ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama a muangte theampo tungah Topa pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom eite atu in, thin sauna taw ama ngakin ih om tu — eite hong ngum tu in ama ngakin ih om tu — phabel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ih khan moi lai in hi thinsauna sin tu phabel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngimna ih thuak ciang thinsauna taw thimdide in eima nguak ih to tu ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kipum aapin ih kun tu ahi hi, banghang ziam cile lametna om thei lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hong kivua in hong kizawngsak kale tuate theampo ih saang thiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa sia hesuakna taw kidim a, a tawntungin eite hong nial ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in eite heena hong thuaksak thei tu hi, ahihang ama ii eite hong itna sia maan in kho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in eite hong khuangaisak, hong natsak sia nuamsa tuan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in thong sungah thinngimna ih thuak ciang hong heaksak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama ii eite hong piak hamphatna te ih taan ciang hong heaksak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />thukhenzum ah thutang khenna a om ngawl ciang, ama in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa deina sia bekma kiseam suak tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama thu piakna zui in a pha le a sia a kibangin piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ih mawna hangin daan hong kipiak ciang banghang phuphun tu hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ih kalsuan nate en pha kikin Topa kungah heak kik tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Vantung a om ih Pathian tungah ih thinsung kongkha hongin thungen tawng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“ Topa awng, kote mawin, kong langpan zo uh a, nangma in nong maisak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Nangma in kote nong zuizen a nong thatlum hi; na thin uukna in na hesuakna seal hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />na thinsona meeikaai sia saa leih ahikom kote thungetnate nang kungah hong theng zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nangma in kote simlei ninthuk nong sua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Ka ngalte theampo in kote hong selno in hong nunau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kote in tuasiatna le siatna ka thuak zo uh a, launa le kiitakna sungah ka nungta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka mite siatna hu in ka thituite ngun bangin luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Ka thituite sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa in vantung pan hong ensuk a, eite hong mu dong a kangmaw lui bangin luang vapua top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Khuapi sungah numeite bang tawk ziam ci sia ka mu ciang ka khuangai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Kei hong ngaimawk natu thu a nei ngawl ngalte in, vacim khat bangin thaang sungah kei hong awksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate in leidum khat sungah hingtangin hong khiasuk a suang khat taw akua vang khak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tui in hong khuum tu in kithoai a, tuaciang thina a nai sia ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“ Topa awng, dum tawtawngh panin nang kong sam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Kong sapna hong ngai ta'n ci in kong nget ciangin nong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nong zo a, lau heak in nong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“ Topa awng, kei hong suatak tu in nong pai a, ka nuntakna nong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Kei sangah pangin thu hong khen ta'n; kei tungah a maan ngawl hong kivawtnate na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ka ngalte ii hong etsatzia le hong thasawm zia na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“ Topa awng, amate ii kei hong lan nate na za zo hi, amate ii hong thasawm nate theampo na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Amate in sunkhuateak in kei thu kikum in vaihawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Amate in kei sia zingsang pan khuazan dong ciammuina in hong nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />“ Topa awng, amate a ngamtatnate hu in daan pia in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Amate haamsiat in, thinkiamna taw kidimsak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Amate vai zui in a, leitung pan phiat keak in!”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ih khamh tee vakilte mualmang zo hi; Biakinnpi sakna suangte lampi ah kithethaang in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion ii tangvalnote sia khamh bangin ei atu in manpha hi, ahihang tu in leibeal thawthongte bangin kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngiapui khat ngawngawn zongh in a note ou tu hi, ahihang ka mite ahile a tate tungah a ngilo kalaoh vacim puite bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in a nausente ngilkial dangtaak in thisak hi; tanote in an ngen a, ahihang kuama in amate an pia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An phabel a ne ngei mihingte sia lampi ah anngawlin pukthi uh hi; a nuamsa in a khangte in an zongin ninbung tok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite sia thakhat thu in Pathian khut sa a thuak Sodom a teang mihingte sangin nasia zaw in daan kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ih kumpi tapate sia kiihuai ngawl hi, vuuk bangin thiangtho a, thahat in taktai a ciidam sitset uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in amate sia kuama heak ngawlin lampi ah kisial uh a; thi in a mai mual uh hi; a vun uh tun a, thingko bangin ko in a ngute tungah bel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngal sungah a thite sia nuntak zawk natu an om ngawl a, dadam in a thi, a thi khakte sangin phazaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mite tungah a tung tuasiatna sia cizat huai mama hi, a nute in a neak tu in a tanote huan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in a thinsona teng nasia takin hong buak hi. ama in mei taw Zion halin kaanghtumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuama peuma, ngamdang ngamukte ngawngawn in Jerusalem ii kongpite sungah ngalte tum thei tu ci in um ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang hisia thu piang hi, banghang ziam cile a kamsaangte maw a, a thiampite in mawnei ngawl mihingte a a thisak uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mittawte bangin a lampuite lampite ah vakvai uh a, chisan baang ngawp ahikom kuama in amate tham ngam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihingte in amate oksan a, “Tai vun! note kiihuai nu hi! Kei hong thutha heak vun!” ci uh hi. Tua ahikom amate ngam khat pan ngam khat ah pai kawkoai a, kuama in muak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in amate awlmaw nawn ngawl a; amate thethaang hi. Ama in ih thiampite le ih lampuite bangma in hong hensak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eite in hong pai ngeingawl tu bul huna lamen in khuadak zawk nawn ngawl tu dong khua ih dadak hi. Eite in piak tu a nei ngawl ngam khat tung pan huna ih ngangak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngalte in eite hong encik a; lampite ah vak zongh ih vak thei bua hi. Ih nite bo zo a; a tawpna hong theng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Muvanlaite van pan suktun a hong len sang a manlang zaw in amate in ei hong zuizen suk hi. Amate in mual tungah ei hong sul zui a; sennealngam ah muanmawk ngawlin ei hong phaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in ngalte khut sung pan hong dal zo tu in ih muan, ih nuntakna ii naak a hi, Topa tealsa kumpipa sia man uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom le Uz mite awng, nui vun; na lungdam thei uh lai teng lungdam vun. Na tuasiat natu uh zongh hong tung tu hi; note zongh maizumna taw na pumnguakin na hoi vacit tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zion in a mawna thaman pia zo a; Topa in eite saltaang in hong koi nawn ngawl tu hi. Ahihang Edom awng, Topa in nang daan hong pia tu hi; ama in na ngamtat khialnate pholaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ko tungah hong piang thute phawk in. Kote hong en ta'n a, ka maizumna uh mu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kote neisa sia khualmite khut sungah om a; ngamdangmite sia koma inn sungah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Koma pate sia ngalte in thatlum zo a, tu in koma nute sia meingong suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote dawn tu tuite man piak kul a, kote thu tu thingkangte lei kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kalaohte le laate bangin hong kihawl ngawp a, toi mama hikale ung hong tawlngasak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuntak khom natu an ka nga natu uh in Egypt le Assyria ah an ngenin ka pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Koma taanghpupite mawna hi a; ahihang tu in amate om nawn ngawl hi, amate mawna hu in kote in ngimna ka thuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Silate sangin a phazaw tuan ngawl mihingte in ko hong uk a, amate khut sung pan kuama in hong hun zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngam sungah mithatte vak kawkoai a, an ka zon uh ciang, luangkhaamin ka zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngilkialna in ka ci uh hong suuksak a, koma vunte meikhuk bangin a sat dong ka thuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion Mualtung mama ah koma ii zite hong buansak uh a; Judah ngam khuano theampo ah koma ii tanute zothaw in khialpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koma ii lampuite hong matsakin ngui awksak a; koma ii pasal huaite hong zataksak bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koma ii tangvalte sia silate bangin zawthawk thu taw an ngoaisak uh a; patangnote sia a thing puak uh khopin hoi vatut uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khanghaamte khuapi kongpi ah to nawn ngawl a, khangmoite sia tengtongh tum nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kote nuntakna sungah lungdamna bo zo a; kote ngualnop lapna teng sia khuangaina taw kilaih zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ko kiphatsakpui nate khat zongh taang nawn ngawl hi. Kote ka maw uh a, tu in a bo ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kote ii ka thin ka lung mama uh na a, ka thituite uh hangin pha tak khua ka mu thei bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zion Mual sia ngamkhing ngamdai in kinusia ahikom tua a kisia sa munte ah ngam uite vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nangma sia a tawntung kumpipa na hi a, hun tawp dongin na uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghangin tu tanvei kote hong nusia ni ziam? Kote nong phawk kik ngei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kungah ko hong ciapui kik ta'n, Topa ! Hong ciapui kik ta'n! Taanghlai in koma minthanna teng hong pia kik ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahibuale kote a tawntungin hong nial tu ni ziam? Na thin uukna in ciangtan nei ngawl ahi ziam?
  </para>
</usx>
